760">addicted </span><span begin="00:38.760" end="00:39.010">to </span><span begin="00:39.010" end="00:39.510">your </span><span begin="00:39.510" end="00:40.510">punishment</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.940" end="00:46.870"><span begin="00:40.940" end="00:41.190">And </span><span begin="00:41.190" end="00:41.690">you're </span><span begin="00:41.690" end="00:41.940">the </span><span begin="00:41.940" end="00:42.820">master </span><span begin="00:42.820" end="00:43.630">and </span><span begin="00:43.630" end="00:43.880">I </span><span begin="00:43.880" end="00:44.190">am </span><span begin="00:44.190" end="00:44.810">waiting </span><span begin="00:44.810" end="00:45.250">for </span><span begin="00:45.250" end="00:46.870">disaster</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.870" end="00:51.520"><span begin="00:46.870" end="00:46.990">I </span><span begin="00:46.990" end="00:47.400">feel </span><span begin="00:47.400" end="00:49.210">irrational </span><span begin="00:49.210" end="00:49.390">so </span><span begin="00:49.390" end="00:51.080">confrontational</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.520" end="00:56.210"><span begin="00:51.520" end="00:51.700">To </span><span begin="00:51.700" end="00:51.950">tell </span><span begin="00:51.950" end="00:52.200">the </span><span begin="00:52.200" end="00:52.450">truth </span><span begin="00:52.450" end="00:53.640">again </span><span begin="00:53.640" end="00:54.010">i'm </span><span begin="00:54.010" end="00:54.200">getting </span><span begin="00:54.200" end="00:54.570">away </span><span begin="00:54.570" end="00:54.780">with </span><span begin="00:54.780" end="00:56.210">murder</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.210" end="01:00.640"><span begin="00:56.210" end="00:56.400">It </span><span begin="00:56.400" end="00:56.590">isn't </span><span begin="00:56.590" end="00:58.330">possible </span><span begin="00:58.330" end="00:58.580">to </span><span begin="00:58.580" end="00:59.140">never </span><span begin="00:59.1