 </span><span begin="01:17.420" end="01:17.670">back </span><span begin="01:17.670" end="01:18.040">cos </span><span begin="01:18.040" end="01:18.290">I </span><span begin="01:18.290" end="01:18.540">don't </span><span begin="01:18.540" end="01:18.790">even </span><span begin="01:18.790" end="01:19.160">want </span><span begin="01:19.160" end="01:20.220">to</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.220" end="01:26.280"><span begin="01:20.220" end="01:20.410">And </span><span begin="01:20.410" end="01:20.720">I </span><span begin="01:20.720" end="01:21.050">don't </span><span begin="01:21.050" end="01:21.360">need </span><span begin="01:21.360" end="01:22.610">to </span><span begin="01:22.610" end="01:23.360">because </span><span begin="01:23.360" end="01:23.550">i'm </span><span begin="01:23.550" end="01:23.860">getting </span><span begin="01:23.860" end="01:24.110">away </span><span begin="01:24.110" end="01:24.360">with </span><span begin="01:24.360" end="01:26.280">murder</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.280" end="01:30.710"><span begin="01:26.280" end="01:26.470">I </span><span begin="01:26.470" end="01:26.910">feel </span><span begin="01:26.910" end="01:28.400">irrational </span><span begin="01:28.400" end="01:28.650">so </span><span begin="01:28.650" end="01:30.710">confrontational</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.710" end="01:35.330"><span begin="01:30.710" end="01:30.900">To </span><span begin="01:30.900" end="01:31.150">tell </span><span begin="01:31.150" end="01:31.460">the </span><span begin="01:31.460" end="01:32.090">truth </span><span begin="01:32.090" end="01:32.770">again </span><span begin="01:32.770" end="01:33.150">i'm </span><span begin="01:33.150" end="01:33.400">getting </span><span begin="01:33.400" end="01:33.580">away </span><span begin="01:33.580" end="01:33.900">with </span><span begin="01:33.900" end="01:35.330">murder</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.330" end="01:39.870"><span begin="01:35.330" end="01:35.580">It <